## N-001 — Sanskrit transcription / title

**Location:** [U00002](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00002), [U00006](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00006)

**Problem and evidence:** The e-text gives two forms of the Sanskrit title; the first runs into a biharati sma formula. The multi-script title leaf has been viewed, not independently edited as a Sanskrit witness.

**Working treatment:** Retain the e-text's Sanskrit transcription in the aligned source. Translate the title principally through its explicit Tibetan equivalent and label the rendering provisional.

**Uncertainty:** The Sanskrit word division, vowel lengths, and final formula need specialist confirmation; no corrected Sanskrit archetype is asserted.

**Review action:** Check the title's scripts and Sanskrit against the selected scan before approving the title.

