**Problem and evidence:** The text distinguishes chapters and expression, lists six arrays, and then gives a compressed remainder whose designation boundaries are unclear. Bringing '[it]' down upon itself has an unstated object.

**Working treatment:** Retain all six arrays in order, identify gnyis as the two topics rather than inventing two chapters, and keep the remainder as a provisional nominal list. Supply the unstated object only as bracketed it.

**Uncertainty:** The remainder may contain titles or functions, but no authoritative title inventory is asserted. Chapter-scope wording and the object at U00683 need review.

**Review action:** Compare the six actual closing chapter formulas and resolve the remainder's boundaries without adding or deleting members.

