## N-045 — Proper names / source variant / compressed designation

**Location:** [U00767](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00767), [U00769](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00769), [U00772](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00772), [U00777](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00777), [U00780](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00780), [U00784](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00784), [U00789](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00789), [U00790](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00790), [U00792](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00792), [U00795](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00795), [U00799](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00799), [U00800](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00800), [U00802](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00802), [U00803](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00803), [U00805](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00805), [U00811](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00811), [U00814](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00814), [U00816](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00816), [U00837](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00837), [U00846](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00846), [U00849](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00849), [U00862](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00862), [U00869](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00869), [U00871](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00871), [U00880](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00880), [U00881](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00881), [U00882](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00882), [U00885](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00885), [U00890](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00890), [U00893](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00893), [U00894](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00894), [U00901](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00901), [U00906](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00906), [U00913](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00913), [U00915](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00915), [U00917](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00917), [U00929](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00929), [U00931](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00931)

**Problem and evidence:** This section names teachers, patrons, places, and fields, often in descriptive Tibetan but sometimes in syllabic transliteration. The selected text's names are not all identical across the two prophecies. U00800 contains a small-print sa yi variant; yang bcud snying po gsum at U00802 is compressed.

**Working treatment:** Translate descriptive names provisionally and transliterate the syllabic names without substituting familiar historical identities. Keep Glorious Protector/Glory-Holder and Glory of Joy/Deity of Bliss distinct as written. Retain the sa yi variant separately. Render the explicit threefold yang/bcud/snying po sequence without inventing three named scriptures.

**Uncertainty:** Name boundaries, Sanskrit spellings, historical identifications, and the scope of the sa yi note are not established; Sūtrade, Jaya Ākar, Bharabhati Sāli, and Śākya Dzīka are provisional source-based forms.

**Review action:** Approve a proper-name concordance against the selected scan, retaining differences unless a documented emendation is authorized.

**Saved associated scan pages (mapping unverified):** 32, 33, 34, 35, 36, 37, 38.

