## N-046 — Descriptive signs / spatial syntax

**Location:** [U00830](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00830), [U00831](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00831), [U00832](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00832), [U00833](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00833), [U00834](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00834), [U00841](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00841), [U00842](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00842), [U00843](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00843), [U00850](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00850), [U00851](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00851), [U00852](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00852), [U00853](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00853), [U00857](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00857), [U00858](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00858), [U00863](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00863), [U00864](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00864), [U00865](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00865), [U00875](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00875), [U00876](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00876), [U00877](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00877), [U00886](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00886), [U00895](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00895), [U00896](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00896)

**Problem and evidence:** The prophetic descriptions include unusual bodily signs. U00843 describes a triangular eye and covering from below upward; U00875–U00877 describes an emerald-colored projection on an arm. U00858 permits ambiguity between arising from the Vajra Seat toward the west and appearing west of it.

**Working treatment:** Preserve the unusual descriptions rather than rationalizing them into diagnoses or identifying real persons. Use the spatial west-of reading provisionally and leave the arm projection nonspecific instead of inventing a named lesion.

**Uncertainty:** The detailed eye and arm constructions and the directional attachment at U00858 need review. These are translated source descriptions, not medical or historical conclusions.

**Review action:** Review the complete descriptive clauses and their case relations against the scan; do not normalize the signs to a familiar legend without evidence.

**Saved associated scan pages (mapping unverified):** 34, 35, 36, 37.

