**Location:** [U00971](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00971), [U00972](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00972), [U00973](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00973), [U00974](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00974), [U00975](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00975), [U00976](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00976), [U00977](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00977), [U00978](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00978), [U00979](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00979), [U00980](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00980), [U00981](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00981), [U00982](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00982), [U00983](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00983), [U00984](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00984), [U00985](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00985), [U00986](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00986), [U00987](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00987), [U00988](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00988), [U00989](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00989), [U00990](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00990), [U00991](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00991), [U00992](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00992), [U00993](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00993), [U00994](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00994), [U00995](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00995), [U00996](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00996), [U00997](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00997), [U00998](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00998), [U00999](alignment/chapter-01.md#u00999), [U01000](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01000)

**Problem and evidence:** The transmission account names Vajrahe, Mañjuśrīpati, Śrīsiddha, and Jñānasūtra in the selected text. Some resemble names familiar from other accounts, but the written forms must not be silently harmonized. The passage explicitly says 1,002 buddhas, twelve wheels of teaching, and thirty-six deeds.

**Working treatment:** Follow the supplied syllables provisionally, retaining the Tibetan in the alignment, and preserve all three numerical counts. Translate the four birth modes in their stated order, including warmth rather than substituting an unprinted term.

**Uncertainty:** Sanskrit reconstruction and identification with persons named differently in other accounts are not established. The names here are translation/transliteration choices, not a historical lineage verification.

**Review action:** Approve the source-based name spellings and compare the numerical lists without normalizing them to a familiar external scheme.

**Saved associated scan pages (mapping unverified):** 39, 40.

