## N-076 — Relative/ultimate spheres / partner terminology / practice referents

**Location:** [U01597](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01597), [U01598](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01598), [U01599](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01599), [U01600](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01600), [U01601](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01601), [U01602](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01602), [U01603](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01603), [U01604](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01604), [U01605](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01605), [U01606](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01606), [U01607](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01607), [U01608](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01608), [U01609](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01609), [U01610](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01610), [U01611](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01611), [U01612](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01612), [U01613](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01613), [U01614](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01614), [U01615](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01615), [U01616](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01616), [U01617](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01617), [U01618](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01618), [U01619](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01619)

**Problem and evidence:** The relative-sphere passage names a rigs ma and social/divine classes but does not enumerate the required characteristics. The actual objects of reliance and focus, the exchange of body and ordinary mind, and packing the lamp are compressed. The source contains a caste hierarchy.

**Working treatment:** Preserve the relative/ultimate distinction and sphere terminology, translate the family-woman designation provisionally, and retain rather than endorse the source's caste wording. Do not add missing characteristics, sexual anatomy, coercive instructions or an operational technique. Preserve the canonical lamp of the empty sphere.

**Uncertainty:** The sphere's precise physical/visionary scope, rigs ma, the exchange construction and packing verb need specialist review.

**Review action:** Approve whole-expression usage in context and review the clauses as historical religious text; this draft is not authorization or guidance for undertaking a partner practice.

