**Location:** [U01802](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01802), [U01803](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01803), [U01804](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01804), [U01805](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01805), [U01806](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01806), [U01807](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01807), [U01808](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01808), [U01809](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01809), [U01810](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01810), [U01811](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01811), [U01812](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01812), [U01813](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01813), [U01814](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01814), [U01815](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01815), [U01816](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01816), [U01817](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01817), [U01818](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01818), [U01819](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01819), [U01820](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01820), [U01821](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01821), [U01822](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01822), [U01823](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01823), [U01824](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01824), [U01825](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01825), [U01826](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01826), [U01827](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01827), [U01828](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01828), [U01829](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01829), [U01830](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01830), [U01831](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01831), [U01832](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01832)

**Problem and evidence:** At U01803 the print distinguishes main sa ya bzhi from small gzhi yang byung. The lteb dang gtugs report has uncertain attachment. At U01811–U01812 the main verse reads lo stong zhag kyang 'bum phrag gsum; the small variant reads lo ste zhag kyang bcu phrag gsum yang byung. The entire U01829 expression is a small-print alternative beside the main U01830 wording. The stars' not being two and ascending/descending halves are not unambiguously explained.

**Working treatment:** Retain four million without inventing a unit, preserve the unattached report, and translate the main thousand-years/300,000-days statement without normalizing it to 360,000. Collect the cross-unit variant separately. Mark U01829 as a variant, not an extra main count. Preserve 180 without supplying days, and leave the half-cycle and star constructions provisional.

**Uncertainty:** The gzhi replacement scope, lteb/gtugs attachment, intended year/day arithmetic, and the lunar-versus-annual scope of the halves remain unresolved despite clear typographical separation.

**Review action:** Check all calculation claims against the selected witness and document emendations separately. Apply the U01821–U01822 alignment corrections. The cropped scans establish typography, not the correctness of the arithmetic.

**Saved associated scan pages (mapping unverified):** 70, 71, 72.

