## N-084 — Omens / uncertain compound / enumerated populations

**Location:** [U01833](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01833), [U01834](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01834), [U01835](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01835), [U01836](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01836), [U01837](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01837), [U01838](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01838), [U01839](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01839), [U01840](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01840), [U01841](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01841), [U01842](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01842), [U01843](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01843), [U01844](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01844), [U01845](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01845), [U01846](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01846), [U01847](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01847), [U01848](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01848), [U01849](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01849), [U01850](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01850), [U01851](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01851), [U01852](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01852), [U01853](alignment/chapter-01.md#u01853)

**Problem and evidence:** The list relates winds, light, sounds, earthquakes, reflections and vanishing to weather, crops and social groups. sa g.yos mnyam and ri khri g.yo are unclear; ri khri could involve a throne designation or a numerical mountain construction. The text supplies no worked calculation.

**Working treatment:** Retain all phenomena, groups and harvests, leave evenness and mountain-throne visibly provisional, and do not turn the list into a contemporary weather, political or agricultural forecast.

**Uncertainty:** The two compounds and the attachment of vanishing into space need source-based review. No predictive reliability is established by translation.

**Review action:** Resolve the glyphs and compounds with authorized witnesses or commentary, keeping any proposed reading outside the unchanged source.

**Saved associated scan pages (mapping unverified):** 72.

