## N-089 — Tenet-system terminology / cross-batch continuation

**Location:** [U02000](alignment/chapter-01.md#u02000)

**Problem and evidence:** The opening statement names two aspects of grub mtha'i dgongs pa; the enumeration follows in the next batch. grub mtha' is absent from the active glossary, while dgongs pa has an established mapping.

**Working treatment:** Provisionally use tenet systems while preserving enlightened intent. Carry the colon and the twofold promise into the continuation rather than supplying a familiar school classification.

**Uncertainty:** The scope of the two aspects must be read from U02001 onward, not inferred from this introductory line.

**Review action:** Review the complete following account and propose the tenet-system term separately from the established enlightened-intent entry.

