**Location:** [U02885](alignment/chapter-02.md#u02885), [U02886](alignment/chapter-02.md#u02886), [U02887](alignment/chapter-02.md#u02887), [U02888](alignment/chapter-02.md#u02888), [U02889](alignment/chapter-02.md#u02889), [U02890](alignment/chapter-02.md#u02890), [U02891](alignment/chapter-02.md#u02891), [U02892](alignment/chapter-02.md#u02892), [U02893](alignment/chapter-02.md#u02893)

**Problem and evidence:** U02885 is a separately printed explanatory gloss. Another small gloss, 'di'i dus na rlung 'dren pa gnad yin no, is interleaved with the main retaining/directing verse across U02887–U02889. The main mkha' rig pa la gtad construction does not unambiguously authorize reversing its written object order.

**Working treatment:** Translate U02885 as a source gloss. Gather the second gloss in U02889 with an explicit cross-unit label, retaining the main bskyil at U02887 and the following main clause at U02888. Preserve directing space toward awareness as a queried literal attachment rather than silently rewriting awareness toward space.

**Uncertainty:** The intended direction of the main instruction and the elements' dispersal/spreading phrase remain unresolved. Typography establishes layers, not the correct practical interpretation.

**Review action:** Review the main clause and gloss at full resolution with authorized contextual evidence; preserve their separation in all reading outputs.

