**Location:** [U04585](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04585), [U04586](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04586), [U04587](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04587), [U04588](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04588), [U04589](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04589), [U04590](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04590), [U04591](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04591), [U04592](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04592), [U04593](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04593), [U04595](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04595), [U04596](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04596), [U04597](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04597), [U04598](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04598), [U04599](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04599), [U04600](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04600), [U04601](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04601), [U04602](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04602), [U04603](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04603), [U04604](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04604), [U04605](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04605), [U04606](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04606), [U04607](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04607), [U04611](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04611), [U04612](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04612), [U04613](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04613), [U04614](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04614), [U04615](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04615), [U04616](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04616), [U04617](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04617), [U04618](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04618), [U04619](alignment/chapter-04.md#u04619)

**Problem and evidence:** The text separately explains chos and nyid, then gives a compressed relation of preliminaries, main practice, intrinsic abiding and bcos ma. Eight arising times and as many abiding times are stated, plus four distinctive times, without listing them.

**Working treatment:** Expose the source's two-part word explanation while retaining nature of phenomena as the canonical complete expression. Bracket practice after contrived in the provisional parse. Preserve every stated count without inventing its members.

**Uncertainty:** The attachment of gnas la bsgyur and the role of bcos ma at U04605 remain open; original course is a provisional rendering of dkyus ma.

**Review action:** Review the whole practice-stage clause and the relation of the time counts, not just individual lexical matches.

**Saved associated scan pages (mapping unverified):** 173, 174.

