**Problem and evidence:** The source juxtaposes uprooting samsara and nirvana, sharpness cutting nothing, spaciousness holding nothing, and all/one reversals involving killing and fetters. Several objects are omitted.

**Working treatment:** Keep the images, explicit one/all/hundred contrasts, and negatives. Bracket thing where supplied. Do not replace the imagery with instructions to harm or a confidently invented doctrinal explanation.

**Uncertainty:** The subjects and symbolic objects of striking/holding and the phrase grol lam zad remain open.

**Review action:** Review the whole symbolic section rather than isolating an imperative; establish referents from authorized commentary before explanatory expansion.

