**Location:** [U05039](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05039), [U05040](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05040), [U05041](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05041), [U05042](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05042), [U05043](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05043), [U05044](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05044), [U05045](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05045), [U05046](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05046), [U05047](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05047), [U05048](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05048), [U05049](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05049), [U05050](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05050), [U05051](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05051), [U05052](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05052), [U05053](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05053), [U05054](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05054), [U05055](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05055), [U05056](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05056), [U05057](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05057), [U05058](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05058), [U05059](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05059), [U05060](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05060), [U05061](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05061), [U05062](alignment/chapter-05.md#u05062)

**Problem and evidence:** After paradoxical language, the source explicitly requires maintaining offerings, mantra, vows and pledges, and forbids disparaging women, companions, the lama and the aggregates. Desire and attachment are handled through successive instructions rather than a single simple prohibition.

**Working treatment:** Retain each instruction and its order, including the apparent arouse/do-not-attach/let-go sequence. Bracket your own in U05045. Keep ordinary mind in the prohibition on disturbing the virtuous.

**Uncertainty:** The exact objects of mtho mi btsam and the sense of sku yi rgya remain provisional; gesture is an unapproved working term for standalone phyag rgya, not the canonical Mahamudra compound.

**Review action:** Review sequence and scope without letting earlier ritual negations erase these explicit requirements.

